                         * Nothing is in flight any more, so the box is re-derived
                         * from the record — the single point where "what should be
                         * showing" is recomputed rather than assumed.
                         *
                         * Idempotent after a reply that already painted (the
                         * record and the paint agree). It EARNS its place on the
